<view class="page-upload">
  <view class="title">菜品图片管理</view>

  <view class="section">
    <view class="section-title">图片导入方式</view>
    <view class="desc">菜品图片已通过后端脚本导入，存储在服务器的 static/images/ 目录中。</view>
    <view class="desc">如需更新图片，请按以下步骤操作：</view>
  </view>

  <view class="section">
    <view class="section-title">1. 下载图片</view>
    <view class="desc">运行爬虫脚本下载新图片：</view>
    <view class="code">python crawler/download_images.py</view>
  </view>

  <view class="section">
    <view class="section-title">2. 导入到后端</view>
    <view class="desc">运行导入脚本，将图片复制到 static 目录并更新数据库：</view>
    <view class="code">python backend/scripts/import_images.py</view>
  </view>

  <view class="section">
    <view class="section-title">3. 重启后端</view>
    <view class="desc">重启 FastAPI 服务使更改生效：</view>
    <view class="code">cd backend && uvicorn main:app --reload</view>
  </view>

  <view class="status" wx:if="{{status}}">
    <text>{{status}}</text>
  </view>

  <view class="tips">
    <view class="tips-title">图片命名规则</view>
    <view class="tip">文件名必须与数据库中的 filename 对应，如：</view>
    <view class="tip">fanqie_chaodan.jpg → 番茄炒蛋</view>
    <view class="tip">hongshao_rou.jpg → 红烧肉</view>
    <view class="tip">完整文件名列表见 crawler/download_images.py</view>
  </view>
</view>
